; A runtime "cannot call" error in a top-level form re-runs every earlier form
; (the unbound-variable trigger of closed #4355 is fixed; this one is not).
; Run: AURA_SANDBOX=off AURA_PIPELINE_STRICT=0 aura probes/cannot_call_rerun.aura
; Expected: one / error: cannot call: z    Pinned tip: one / one / error ...
(display "one")
(newline)
(define (f x) (+ x 1))
(define z 0)
(display (f (z 1)))
(newline)
